# What the host has and the image must not inherit.
#
# `COPY packages ./packages` takes the working tree as it is, and the working tree has build output
# in it: a `dist/` from a `pnpm build` run here lands in the image beside the one the web stage
# builds, and the two have different names because they are different builds. The stale index.html
# wins, and what runs in the browser is whatever was last built on somebody's laptop.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out

# State, keys and the local plane's own directory. None of it is the image's business.
.demo
.deploy-itest
.pki
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
.claude
site
